# counter harness. Each ASE COMPUTE is one pes.evaluate of morse/smooth/linear, periodic in x and y. That is OPTIM's energy+gradient call, not a Rayleigh-Ritz step.
# OPTIM df8da599267534fbe43a250e578f7396a7946311 from http://www-wales.ch.cam.ac.uk/svn.tar.bz2 sha256 738fafe3df5ad73100b7e7d7bbbc407ee8cd5d969c2c0a58f2c109167f463d31. BFGSTS with USEDIAG 2. NEVS, NEVL, BFGSSTEPS, and STEPS are the problem cap. NBFGSMAX1 10, NBFGSMAX2 100, and CEIG 1.0D-10 are the source defaults. BFGSCONV is the Euclidean force norm over sqrt(3N). NOHESS because ASE returns no Hessian. READVEC is initial minus reactant. A success is under the cap, at the force stop, and Hessian index 1.
